Title: Dense head subset and vocabulary pruning for 12GB VRAM offload (base model and MTP / speculative drafting)
Add-on: Keeps the top N most frequent vocabulary rows (and special tokens) of the output head
in GPU VRAM for base dense model decoding and/or MTP speculative draft steps. Cuts decode
latency when lm_head is offloaded to host RAM by avoiding full-head CPU read bandwidth
bottleneck (~1GB/tok). Verification pass in speculative decoding can remain full-head and
mathematically exact.
Requires: 0002-moe-hybrid-strata.patch

